       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI60504.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI60504.                                         *
      *                                                                *
      *     Criar Nova Reconciliação                                   *
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           DECIMAL-POINT IS COMMA.

       DATA DIVISION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI60504         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8201 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD7204 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV6050.
       COPY SWCV6051.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAL0030.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.

       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
       COPY AQCW0005.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *01  SW-SWITCH.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8201                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8201'.
           05 CON-SWVT7204                 PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWVT7204'.
PML        05 CON-RC                       PIC  X(02) VALUE 'RC'.
PML        05 CON-M                        PIC  X(01) VALUE 'M'.
PML        05 CON-1PARA0                   PIC  X(03) VALUE '1:0'.
           05 CON-O00                      PIC  X(03) VALUE 'O00'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            VARIAVEIS
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-IDRECONC-AUX              PIC  9(17).
           05 WS-IDRECONC                  PIC  X(17).
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-IDRECONC.
              10 WS-IDRECONC-DATA          PIC  X(06).
              10 WS-IDRECONC-SEQ           PIC  9(11).

           05 WS-DTRECONC                  PIC  9(08) VALUE ZEROS.
           05 FILLER REDEFINES WS-DTRECONC.
              10 FILLER                    PIC  X(02).
              10 WS-DTRECONC-ANT           PIC  X(06).

           05 WS-MRNOPR                    PIC  9(10) VALUE ZEROS.
           05 WS-MRNORD                    PIC S9(07) VALUE ZEROS.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME                  PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI60504'.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC  X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI60504         '.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0004.

            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV6050-MSG
                                              SWCV6051-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6050-ADE               TO SWCV6051-ADE.

       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6050-MRNOPR            TO SWCV6051-MRNOPR.
           MOVE SWCV6050-MRNORD            TO SWCV6051-MRNORD.

           PERFORM 2100-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2200-INSERE-SWT82
                 THRU 2200-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2300-UPDATE-SWT72
                 THRU 2300-UPDATE-SWT72-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2100-VALIDACOES
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2100-VALIDACOES.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2100-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

       2100-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2200-INSERE-SWT82
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2200-INSERE-SWT82.

           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2200-INSERE-SWT82 '    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6050-IDRECON           TO SWCD8201-IDRECONC
                                              SWCV6051-IDRECONC.
           MOVE 1                          TO SWCD8201-NSEQ.
           IF SWCV6050-MRNOPR EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD8201-MRNOPR
           ELSE
              COMPUTE SWCD8201-MRNOPR = FUNCTION NUMVAL(SWCV6050-MRNOPR)
           END-IF.
           IF SWCV6050-MRNORD EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD8201-MRNORD
           ELSE
              COMPUTE SWCD8201-MRNORD = FUNCTION NUMVAL(SWCV6050-MRNORD)
           END-IF.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD8201-COSN.
           MOVE SPACES                     TO SWCD8201-COSNC.
           MOVE VIAL0001-DATA-PROCESSO-I   TO SWCD8201-DATREC
                                              SWCV6051-DATAOPE.
           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD8201-CUSERID.

           EXEC SQL
              INSERT INTO SWVT8201
                   ( IDRECONC
                   , NSEQ
                   , MRNOPR
                   , MRNORD
                   , COSN
                   , COSNC
                   , DATREC
                   , CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST
                   )
            VALUES (
                     :SWCD8201-IDRECONC
                   , :SWCD8201-NSEQ
                   , :SWCD8201-MRNOPR
                   , :SWCD8201-MRNORD
                   , :SWCD8201-COSN
                   , :SWCD8201-COSNC
                   , :SWCD8201-DATREC
                   , :SWCD8201-CUSERID
                   , CURRENT TIMESTAMP
                   )
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8201               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
           END-IF.

       2200-INSERE-SWT82-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2300-UPDATE-SWT72
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       2300-UPDATE-SWT72.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2300-UPDATE-SWT72 '    TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV6050-MRNOPR EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR
           ELSE
              COMPUTE WS-MRNOPR = FUNCTION NUMVAL(SWCV6050-MRNOPR)
              MOVE WS-MRNOPR               TO SWCD7204-MRNOPR
           END-IF.
           IF SWCV6050-MRNORD EQUAL SPACES
              MOVE ZEROS                   TO SWCD7204-MRNORD
           ELSE
              COMPUTE WS-MRNORD = FUNCTION NUMVAL(SWCV6050-MRNORD)
              MOVE WS-MRNORD               TO SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6050-IDRECON           TO SWCD7204-IDRECONC.
PML        MOVE CON-RC                     TO SWCD7204-CCODEST.
PML        MOVE CON-M                      TO SWCD7204-CTIPREC.
PML        MOVE CON-1PARA0                 TO SWCD7204-CNATREC.
           MOVE CON-O00                    TO SWCD7204-CNIVREC.

           MOVE WS-PROGNAME                TO SWCD7204-CUSERID.

           EXEC SQL
              UPDATE SWVT7204
                 SET IDRECONC = :SWCD7204-IDRECONC
PML                , CCODEST  = :SWCD7204-CCODEST
PML                , CTIPREC  = :SWCD7204-CTIPREC
PML                , CNATREC  = :SWCD7204-CNATREC
                   , CNIVREC  = :SWCD7204-CNIVREC
                   , CUSERID  = :SWCD7204-CUSERID
                   , HTIMEST  = CURRENT TIMESTAMP
               WHERE MRNOPR   = :SWCD7204-MRNOPR
                 AND MRNORD   = :SWCD7204-MRNORD
           END-EXEC.

           MOVE CON-SWVT7204               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

           IF NOT DB2-OK
              SET VIAL0002-ABEND-DB2       TO TRUE
           END-IF.

       2300-UPDATE-SWT72-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA'   TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV6051-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV6051-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV6051-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY VIAP0015.
           COPY ARCR0039.
           COPY AQCP0005.
